**So What**: This isn't a presentation problem — it's a foundational ambiguity. The question "what does Synchronism predict?" has no definite answer for galactic-scale tests until the framework commits to one formulation. This diagnosis, if taken seriously, shifts the research direction from "present the theory better" to "decide what the theory actually is."

